{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31131","headline":"雨霁北归留题三学山 · 薛能","name":"雨霁北归留题三学山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"远树平川半夕阳，锦城遥辨立危墙。\n闲思胜事多遗恨，却悔公心是谩忙。\n灌口阙寻慙远客，峨嵋乖约负支郎。\n灵龛一望终何得，谬有人情满蜀乡。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛能","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31131.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31131","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}